  Description: Prerequisite Region - Old Cheliax Despite the setbacks Cheliax has
    suffered recently, your loyalties lie with the devil-backed House Thrune. You
    consider the current queen to be the rightful ruler of your homeland, and you
    are willing to act against her enemies. Choose two attribute boosts. One must
    be to Intelligence or Charisma , and one is a free attribute boost. You're trained
    in the Religion skill and the Hell Lore skill You gain the @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.feats-srd.Item.Student
    of the Canon] skill feat.
